sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant VM as ViewModel
    participant Store as ReminderStore (Ch 3)
    participant Sched as AlarmScheduler
    participant AM as AlarmManager
    participant Rcv as AlarmReceiver
    participant Notif as NotificationManager

    User->>VM: set reminder for 8:00 PM
    VM->>Store: persist reminder (SSOT)
    VM->>Sched: schedule(reminder)
    Sched->>Sched: canScheduleExactAlarms?
    Sched->>AM: setExactAndAllowWhileIdle(8pm, pendingIntent)
    Note over AM: fires at 8pm, even in Doze, rate-limited
    AM->>Rcv: onReceive at 8pm
    Rcv->>Notif: post reminder notification (Ch 50)
    Rcv->>Store: mark fired / reschedule if repeating
